== (1) the Hadamard identity (1 - 3z)(F * G) = n + z F ==
 identity holds to order 40 for n = 7, 27, 97, 871, 6171, 77031: True
 reading: the orbit series is the termwise quotient of the rational transform (n + zF)/(1 - 3z) by F; Collatz over N is 'G_n rational for every n', and F_n rational iff G_n rational (Polya / Prop 10 of the first note)
